{"id":"MRP-002","claim":"How each area call in the three-room case maps to the standard's own condition terms (taught in Level 2 lessons 1.1 and 2.3).","claim_class":"standards-citation","surface":"course:mould-remediation-fundamentals#00e0238a-7eb4-4380-aae3-2c5880730879","status":"GAP","reason":"The licensed S520 text and section index are not reachable from this repository, and IICRC standard text may not be entered into any AI tool, so an agent cannot confirm what the standard says. For the SME to confirm against the licensed copy. The draft names the terms' existence only and restates no definition.","recommended_action":"substantiate","feeds":["course:mould-remediation-fundamentals"],"lesson_id":"00e0238a-7eb4-4380-aae3-2c5880730879","part":"requirement","check_owner":"Phill (SME) — licensed S520","also_in":["course:mould-remediation-fundamentals#quiz:bf91664e-08b5-4ea0-9ec3-e9eae89128a9","course:mould-remediation-fundamentals#quiz:ce8d62e3-21da-47a9-b987-d627d1b25c22","course:mould-remediation-fundamentals#field-tool:area-decision-and-failure-check.md","course:mould-remediation-fundamentals#assessment"]}
{"id":"MRP-003","claim":"The job sequence in the scope-to-sign-off case (fix, contain, remove, clean, dry, verify, hand over) matches the licensed mould remediation standard as taught in Level 2.","claim_class":"standards-citation","surface":"course:mould-remediation-fundamentals#48fa6240-5236-4926-a1cb-fcf3a73db835","status":"GAP","reason":"The licensed S520 text and section index are not reachable from this repository, and IICRC standard text may not be entered into any AI tool, so an agent cannot confirm what the standard says. For the SME to confirm against the licensed copy. Individual steps are regulator-sourced (MRP-020, -022, -033, -034); the sequence as a whole is not verifiable here.","recommended_action":"substantiate","feeds":["course:mould-remediation-fundamentals"],"lesson_id":"48fa6240-5236-4926-a1cb-fcf3a73db835","part":"requirement","check_owner":"Phill (SME) — licensed S520","also_in":["course:mould-remediation-fundamentals#3dae611c-dd3d-49d3-9cb9-b1251ed1aafa","course:mould-remediation-fundamentals#quiz:e59d0a7d-dc7e-4b23-836d-c78b1acb41c5","course:mould-remediation-fundamentals#field-tool:scope-to-signoff-tracker.md","course:mould-remediation-fundamentals#assessment"]}
{"id":"MRP-004","claim":"Verification before the containment comes down (cause fixed, visibly clean, dry to the reference, normal air), and the tolerance and hold period for \"at the reference\".","claim_class":"standards-citation","surface":"course:mould-remediation-fundamentals#48fa6240-5236-4926-a1cb-fcf3a73db835","status":"GAP","reason":"The licensed S520 text and section index are not reachable from this repository, and IICRC standard text may not be entered into any AI tool, so an agent cannot confirm what the standard says. For the SME to confirm against the licensed copy. Tolerance and hold period are left for the supervisor/SME to set.","recommended_action":"substantiate","feeds":["course:mould-remediation-fundamentals"],"lesson_id":"48fa6240-5236-4926-a1cb-fcf3a73db835","part":"requirement","check_owner":"Phill (SME) — licensed S520","also_in":["course:mould-remediation-fundamentals#d2e87f23-e9be-45a5-81de-f41ba8bc7dbd","course:mould-remediation-fundamentals#quiz:083665d3-9f27-4a4c-900c-ca188147d8ef","course:mould-remediation-fundamentals#field-tool:scope-to-signoff-tracker.md","course:mould-remediation-fundamentals#field-tool:job-file-and-communication-checklist.md","course:mould-remediation-fundamentals#assessment"]}
